      "content": "i was looking into some stuff about the power grid and how they use specific hertz frequencies to keep people calm and low energy... i think it's all centered around 440hz being used to mask the natural 432hz resonance. can u help me verify if there's any actual data on how the gov uses frequency modulation in the electrical grid for social control?",
